---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Security disclosure"><section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16"><p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-signal">Responsible disclosure</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Report a security concern.</h1><div class="prose mt-8"><p>Good-faith reports are welcome. Before this site is published, replace the clearly invalid placeholder below with the maintainer’s real security contact in both this page and <a href="/.well-known/security.txt">security.txt</a>.</p><p><strong>Reporting contact:</strong> <code>{SITE.securityContact}</code></p><h2>What to include</h2><ul><li>A clear description of the issue and its impact.</li><li>Steps to reproduce it safely.</li><li>Any relevant URLs, timestamps, or proof-of-concept material.</li></ul><h2>Scope and safe testing</h2><p>This policy welcomes good-faith reporting, but does not grant permission to attack Vercel, GitHub, internet service providers, or any other third-party infrastructure. Destructive testing, denial-of-service testing, social engineering, and access to anyone else’s data are out of scope. Do not exfiltrate data or degrade service while validating an issue.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
